# Isabella Trejos - Portfolio Redesign Plan

This plan focuses on a modern, neumorphic aesthetic with enhanced interactive features.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - The institutional UAO colors will be shifted towards a more modern palette (Slate/Indigo/Soft Grey).
> - Neumorphism requires specific shadow management; this may slightly increase the "weight" of the UI.
> - Background animations will be kept "sober" (slow and subtle) to avoid eye fatigue.

